-- ============================================================
-- Warrior (Protection): Intervene is free
-- ============================================================
-- Follow-up to woa_2026_08_09_05.sql.
--
-- That file recorded that Intervene "generates no rage" was already true --
-- there is no SPELL_EFFECT_ENERGIZE anywhere in 3411 or 59667.  What it did not
-- check is the other direction: Intervene COSTS 10 rage.
--
--   PowerType 1   = POWER_RAGE
--   ManaCost 100  = 10 rage.  Rage is stored at ten times its displayed value
--                   everywhere in the DBC, which is also why Bloodrage's
--                   description divides by 10 ("$/10;2687s1").
--
-- Charging rage for a purely defensive reposition is backwards under normalised
-- rage.  Rage.FromDamageTaken = 0 turned tank income into a fixed ceiling
-- (worldserver.overrides.conf), so every rage spent is now an ability not cast
-- rather than something a bigger hit will refund.  Intervene competes with
-- Shield Slam and Revenge for the same pool while producing no threat and no
-- damage, and its cooldown is already the thing limiting how often it is used.
--
-- Spells:
--   3411 = Intervene
-- ============================================================

-- Generated by gen_sql.py on 2026-08-09
-- Overrides: ManaCost: 100 -> 0

DELETE FROM `alonecraft_spell_dbc` WHERE `ID` = 3411;
